WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.204
Closing deals takes finding deals.

00:00:03.224 --> 00:00:04.625
But most new-logo reps

00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:06.295
never get the meeting.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:08.736
Kelsey Dalton spent more than 10

00:00:08.756 --> 00:00:11.656
years building and leading new-logo teams.

00:00:12.217 --> 00:00:14.538
Her method fits in three sentences:

00:00:14.558 --> 00:00:18.242
a real reason, real proof, and a small ask.

00:00:18.983 --> 00:00:20.642
It's all in her new playbook:

00:00:20.662 --> 00:00:22.679
The Repeat Success Method.

00:00:23.183 --> 00:00:25.911
Get the free guide from Root and Reinvent.
